A(('p', '4.2 The sayings after the story. They are set out below in the words of the KJV. Whose voice speaks the second part of 16:8 is not marked in the text, and 16:9 begins with “And I say unto you,” which marks a speaker addressing “you.” The text does not say how 16:9 stands to 16:8.'))
