A(('p', '4.3 What Jesus does not identify. The names given in the sayings are the children of this world and the children of light, the mammon of unrighteousness, the unrighteous mammon, the true riches, that which is another man’s and that which is your own. The text gives no referent for any of them. Jesus does not identify the rich man. Jesus does not identify the steward. Jesus does not identify the debtors, the oil or the wheat. Jesus does not identify “they” in 16:4 or in 16:9. Jesus does not identify the everlasting habitations.'))
